### My Claw iPhone app API — 8examples.com/api/mobile (JetBrains HTTP client)
@host = http://localhost:3000
@fleetToken = oct_changeme
@username = openclaw2
@password = changeme
@clawId = openclaw2

### Login (the claw's own chat.8examples.com credentials)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/mobile/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "{{username}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Me — my claws with phone / website / telegram facts
GET {{host}}/api/mobile/queries/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### "Yes, my claws may know where I am"
POST {{host}}/api/mobile/commands/give-location-consent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Phone reports its position (every 5 minutes)
POST {{host}}/api/mobile/commands/report-location
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"latitude": 51.0447, "longitude": -114.0719, "accuracyMeters": 12}

### My sharing state
GET {{host}}/api/mobile/queries/location-sharing
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### The claw asks: where is my owner? (fleet access token)
GET {{host}}/api/mobile/queries/owner-location?clawId={{clawId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{fleetToken}}

### Stop sharing
POST {{host}}/api/mobile/commands/revoke-location-consent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a message to my claw
POST {{host}}/api/mobile/commands/send-message-to-claw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"clawId": "{{clawId}}", "messageId": "{{$uuid}}", "text": "hello claw"}

### Read the conversation
GET {{host}}/api/mobile/queries/conversation?clawId={{clawId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Relay worker: messages awaiting a reply
GET {{host}}/api/mobile/queries/messages-awaiting-claw-reply
Authorization: Bearer {{fleetToken}}

### Relay worker: the claw answered
POST {{host}}/api/mobile/commands/record-claw-reply
Authorization: Bearer {{fleetToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": "{{username}}", "clawId": "{{clawId}}", "messageId": "<messageId from above>", "text": "hi back"}

### Claw: record its Telegram bot
POST {{host}}/api/mobile/commands/record-claw-telegram-bot
Authorization: Bearer {{fleetToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"clawId": "{{clawId}}", "botUsername": "anas_claw_bot"}

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/mobile/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
